config PM8150_XO
	tristate "PM8150 XO Clock Driver"
	default n
	depends on SPMI
	help
	  Say Y here to enable the PM8150 XO Clock Driver driver. This driver is
	  responsible for PM8150 XO Clock, it adjusts cap between XTAL1_IN_PAD
