config REGULATOR_HL7594
	tristate "HL7594 Buck Converter Driver"
	default n
	depends on I2C
	select REGMAP_I2C
	help
	  This driver controls HL7594 Buck converter via I2C bus and
	  configures the PWM mode through I2C. Say Y here to enable
	  the HL7594 Buck Converter Driver.

config REGULATOR_KTB8399
	tristate "Kinetic KTB8399 External Buck-Boost Converter"
	default n
	depends on I2C
	help
	  This driver controls Kinetic KTB8399 external buck via I2C bus.
	  The converter VOUT is configurable. Its input voltage range is
	  2.5 V to 5.5 V. Its output voltage range is 0.6 V to 1.394 V in
	  6.25 mV steps, programmed through an I2C interface. Say Y here
	  to enable the regulator driver for the converter.

config REGULATOR_MAX77655
