config STUSB4500_USB
	tristate "STUSB4500 USB Controller Driver"
	default n
	depends on I2C
	help
	  Say Y here to enable the STUSB4500 USB controller driver. This driver is
	  responsible for USB PD negotiation and CC detection. It also supports the
	  STUSB4500L chip variant that only does CC detection.

